-| `agdf_prepare` | `presentation.prepare` | Preparation leaves the gate undecided |
-| `agdf_record` | `step.record`, `artefact.record`, `operation.recover` | Actual bounded result and reviewed source mapping |
-| `agdf_approve` | `approval.record` | New deliberate exact gate response and current presentation |
-| `agdf_revise` | Source preview/apply/recovery, early PRD reopen, owned recovery | Apply/reopen require the exact material confirmation selector |
-| `agdf_closeout` | Exact OR registration/completion, owned recovery | Exact Run/revision/UUID/OR confirmation and actual fulfilled obligations |
