-`presentation_language`, `working_directory`, `target_source`, `primary_target`, `target_id`,
-`run_id`, `expected_revision_id`, `operation_id`, `assurance: "cooperative_local"` and
-`command: {kind, payload}`. Unknown fields, cross-group effects and unsafe/foreign source paths
-reject. References contain a contained run-local path and its canonical text digest; document
-read proofs separately bind raw bytes. No arbitrary Run text, shell, callback or validator is input.
-
