-the same service. Legacy commands retain their documented flags and owners. Setting
-`AGDF_MCP_COMMAND_GROUPS` to an exact comma-separated list enables only those groups; an
-empty value disables all five. An unset value enables all five. Unknown, duplicate or
-whitespace-altered names are invalid. Disabling transport never undoes a recorded effect.
-
