-tool permission grants neither another gate decision nor another target. Write tools declare
-read-only false, idempotent false and open-world false; only preparation is non-destructive.
-Annotations describe behavior and are not authorization. These local claims are cooperative,
-not independently authenticated proof that a human generated an input.
